Trigonometry & Hyperbolic Functions:
Standard: sin, cos, tan
Inverse: asin, acos, atan
Hyperbolic: sinh, cosh, tanh, asinh, acosh, atanh
Degree & Radian Modes: One-tap toggle between DEG and RAD with live recalculation.
Powers & Roots: $x^2$, $x^3$, $x^y$, $\sqrt{x}$, $\sqrt[3]{x}$, $\sqrt[y]{x}$, $\frac{1}{x}$, $10^x$, $e^x$, $2^x$.
Logarithms: Natural log ($\ln$), base-10 ($\log_{10}$), base-2 ($\log_2$).
Combinatorics & Probability: Factorial $n!$ (with Lanczos Gamma approximation for non-integers), Permutations $nPr$, Combinations $nCr$, Random number generator rand().
Scientific Constants: Built-in high precision constants:
$\pi \approx 3.1415926535$
$e \approx 2.7182818284$
$\phi \text{ (Golden Ratio)} \approx 1.6180339887$
Planck constant $h$, Speed of Light $c$, Gravitational constant $G$, Boltzmann constant $k_B$.
Memory Registers: Full memory management (MC, MR, M+, M-, MS) with an active memory indicator badge.
Live Formula Syntax Highlighting: Color-coded tokens for numbers, operators, functions, parentheses, and constants.
Instant Live Result Preview: Real-time evaluation output appears softly underneath your input before pressing =.
